#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"The function returns 365 for a normal year and 366 for a leap year.  The "
"calculation for leap year is based on:"
msgstr ""
"La función devuelve 365 para un año normal y 366 para un año bisiesto. El "
"cálculo para un año bisiesto se basa en:"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "(year) %4 == 0 && ((year) %100 != 0 || (year) %400 == 0)\n"
msgstr "(year) %4 == 0 && ((year) %100 != 0 || (year) %400 == 0)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"The formula is defined in the macro I<__isleap(year)> also found in "
"I<E<lt>time.hE<gt>>."
msgstr ""
"La fórmula está definida en la macro I<__isleap(year)> también localizada en "
"I<E<lt>time.hE<gt>>."

